# dyff for Debian

This package contains dyff version 1.12.0-1.

## Installation

```bash
sudo dpkg -i dyff_1.12.0-1_amd64.deb
```

Or use apt:

```bash
sudo apt install ./dyff_1.12.0-1_amd64.deb
```

## Usage

See upstream documentation at https://github.com/homeport/dyff

